 a structural distinction: verified symbolically for n=1..7 that F_n(x) = (-i)^{n-1} U_{n-1}(i x / 2), so the positive-sign family is Chebyshev U at imaginary argument. What is genuinely notable is that the argument is h = q - q^{-1}, real and positive for q>1 — i.e. the tower sits on the hyperbolic branch — and that is a claim about the substrate, not about the recurrence being a new family.","history":2},{"id":"trap-triples","group":"trap","result":"pass","stale":false,"freshness":"fresh","at":"2026-08-22","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:l00","notes":"no trap of this class; full-context read","history":2},{"id":"uses-editorial-hygiene","group":"uses","result":"pass","stale":false,"freshness":"fresh","at":"2026-08-09","reviewer":"script","by":"content/pipeline/qa-checkers-uses.ts","history":1},{"id":"uses-formal-coverage","group":"uses","result":"n/a","stale":false,"freshness":"fresh","at":"2026-08-09","reviewer":"script","by":"content/pipeline/qa-checkers-uses.ts","notes":"block has no .lean sibling","history":1},{"id":"voice-agent-speak","group":"voice","result":"pass","stale":false,"freshness":"fresh","at":"2026-08-09","reviewer":"script","by":"content/pipeline/qa-checkers-extended.ts","history":1},{"id":"voice-ai-slop","group":"voice","result":"pass","stale":false,"freshness":"fresh","at":"2026-07-19","reviewer":"agent","by":"one-voice-audit","notes":"Agentic heuristic check: pass.","history":2},{"id":"voice-author-notes-pollution","group":"voice","result":"pass","stale":false,"freshness":"fresh","at":"2026-08-09","reviewer":"script","by":"content/pipeline/qa-checkers-extended.ts","history":1},{"id":"voice-branch-jargon","group":"voice","result":"pass","stale":false,"freshness":"unknown","changed":["md: on disk, no hash recorded","ts: on disk, no hash recorded"],"at":"2026-08-08","reviewer":"agent","by":"local/one-voice-audit","notes":"[EXPIRED-NO-FIELD-HASH] No branch/audit working labels, agent status markers or first-person work narration found in the .md bod